---
/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   RagEbookEmbed — the OFFICIAL MailerLite embed form (#mlb2-43132124).

   The <form> action, method, target, field names, hidden inputs, success
   handler, and webforms.min.js are kept EXACTLY as MailerLite generated them
   (submitting joins the "Blog Subscribers" group → double opt-in → ebook email).
   Only the visible heading/subtext were reworded, plus brand-styling overrides
   scoped strictly to #mlb2-43132124 so nothing leaks to the rest of the site.
   ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
